v36

## Changes

* Bump default Nix version: 2.34.7 -> 2.34.9

* Add Nix versions 2.35.6 and 2.36.0. Nix 2.36.0 is not available on Intel macOS.

* Update Nix versions: 2.34.7 -> 2.34.9, 2.31.5 -> 2.31.6, 2.30.5 -> 2.30.6, 2.28.7 -> 2.28.8

* Default to `max-jobs = auto` so local Nix builds can use all available CPU cores when `nix_conf` is not supplied ([#78](https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/pull/78)).

* Download Nix archives to a temporary file before unpacking, so interrupted transfers can be retried and HTTP errors are reported as download failures rather than decompression errors ([#79](https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/pull/79)).
